    "details": {
      "alignment": "Neutral",
      "type": {
        "value": "humanoid",
        "subtype": ""
      },
      "cr": 1,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Earl Grey.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, generated from the article's own words. XP ledger: level 2, power rating 3 → CR 1 as a soldier. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Man Who Exploded</strong> — Tea Leaf Syndicate (deceased)</p><p>Status: Deceased — literally exploded during the Syndicate Showdown</p><p>Earl Grey was the primary enforcer for the Tea Leaf Syndicate—a skilled fighter whose loyalty to Green T was matched only by his combat effectiveness. His death during the Syndicate Showdown was the single most dramatic exit Waluigi has ever witnessed: Roger's poisoned dagger interacted with something in Earl Grey's biology, and the man DETONATED. Waluigi's favorite hat was in the blast radius. Waluigi is still upset about the hat.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Dagger</strong> — “His death during the Syndicate Showdown was the single most dramatic exit Waluigi has ever witnessed: Roger's poisoned dagger interacted with something in Earl Grey's biology, and the man DETONATED.”</li><li><strong>Sneak Attack</strong> — “His death during the Syndicate Showdown was the single most dramatic exit Waluigi has ever witnessed: Roger's poisoned dagger interacted with something in Earl Grey's biology, and the man DETONATED.”</li><li><strong>Leadership</strong> — “Deceased — literally exploded during the Syndicate Showdown”</li><li><strong>Coin Sense</strong> — “The hat—custom made, carefully maintained, one of Waluigi's most treasured possessions—was SPLATTERED.”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/earl_grey</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/earl_grey</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
